{"ticker":{"symbol":"462520.KS","name":"조선내화","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":10730.0,"change_pct":-0.020091324200913196,"market_cap":127141208064.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.09319664492078285,"week52_low":10600.0,"week52_high":16600.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","country":"South Korea","city":"Kwangyang","employees":408,"website":"https://www.chosunref.co.kr","business_summary":"Chosun Refractories Co.,Ltd. engages in the manufacture and sale of refractory products. It offers shaped refractories, such as alumina, fireclay, silicon carbide, special, acid-proof and heat-resistant, insulating fire, and magcarbon; monolithic refractories, including castables, gunning refractories, plastic refractories, ramming mix and induction furnace, blast furnace runner refractories, ladle and turndish refractories, flame-gunning repair refractories, mortar, and casting blocks; slide gate valves, comprising top, collector, porous, and sliding nozzles; and sliding nozzle plates. The company also provides continuous casting nozzles, such as shroud, long stopper, and submerged nozzle. Chosun Refractories Co.,Ltd. was founded in 1947 and is based in Kwangyang, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"조선내화(주) 내화제품의 제조 및 판매를 영위하고 있습니다. 알루미나, 내화점토, 탄화규소, 특수, 내산성 및 내열성, 단열 화재 및 마그카본과 같은 성형 내화물을 제공합니다. 캐스터블, 거닝 내화물, 플라스틱 내화물, 래밍 믹스 및 유도로, 용광로 러너 내화물, 레이들 및 턴디시 내화물, 화염 총 수리 내화물, 모르타르 및 주조 블록을 포함한 모놀리식 내화물; 상부, 수집기, 다공성 및 슬라이딩 노즐을 포함하는 슬라이드 게이트 밸브; 슬라이딩 노즐 플레이트. 또한 Shroud, Long Stopper, Submerged Nozzle 등의 연속주조 노즐도 제공하고 있습니다. 조선내화(주) 1947년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 광양에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"건축자재","financials":[{"period":"2023","revenue":279366908000.0,"operating_income":31851793000.0,"net_income":23583498000.0,"eps":1990.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":5006